;; Fred's flooded tunnel under 8-4 (campaign only, docs/HEROES.md): dropped into from Jason's pool
;; (8-4-jason) through the hole in the roof at columns 3-6. It swims like 8-4's water (`swim: true`:
;; from the wave tiles' row down) in the Underworld's look. Fred swims on ahead, staying in front
;; of the hero, to the side pipe at the far end (column 36, on the floor), which leads up into
;; Sophia III's garage (8-4-garage). No enemies, and rows 8-12 are open from end to end (the rocks
;; hang above them), so the tank and every hero, small or big, swim through; a hero who cannot
;; steer once off the ground (Simon) walks the floor all the way. The clock runs on (time:
;; inherit).

